<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>CASTOR: Castor Maritime Inc is registered on the NOTC-list</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2018-12-20 07:47:10</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Castor Maritime Inc is registered on the NOTC-list as of 20 December 2018 with ticker code “CASTOR”.  The company has in total 2,892,000 outstanding shares, 2,400,000 common shares, 480,000 9.75% Series A cumulative redeemable perpetual preferred shares and 12,000 Series B super-voting preferred shares, each with a par value of NOK 0.001. The common shares are registered with American Stock Transfer & Trust Company under ISIN code MHY1146L1092 and will be the shares registered on the NOTC-list. The company has entered into an agreement whereby it will be able to use the NOTC reporting system as from 20 December 2018.<br><br>Castor is a dry bulk shipping company that was established in September 2017. The Company is registered under the laws of Marshall Islands, and the HQ is located in Limassol, Cyprus. The Company and its ongoing operations are managed by CEO, Chairman of the board, and founder Mr. Petros Panagiotidis. The Company currently owns and operates one 2004-built Panamax bulk carrier named Magic P and the ambition is to grow the company further. The Company has a share capital of consisting of common shares, Series A preferred shares and Series B preferred shares. The Company is currently not financed with any bank debt.<br><br>Please see attached Company Presentation</p></td>
</tr>
